TITLE=> Media evicted from Vietnam hotel ahead of Trump-Kim summit. ARTICLE=> Members of the media were told to leave a hotel in Hanoi on Tuesday before the arrival of North Korean leader Kim Jong Un. [SEP] TITLE=> White House press corps evicted from hotel ahead of North Korea summit. ARTICLE=> The forced move was highly unusual because the White House had approved of and supported the use of the space by media who cover the president.
